# Please note that upstream does NOT distribute a monolithic tarball.
# You have to build the tarball yourself by calling this command:
#
#   sh debian/mkorig $VERSION
#
# What this watch file does is output the latest value that you can use
# for $VERSION. This is useful for services like the DEHS.
# Do not call this watchfile with "uscan". It will download
# a useless file. What you can do, though, is use "uscan --no-download"
# to see when you should call debian/mkorig again.

version=3
http://www.smlnj.org/ \
		      dist/working/(.*)/index.html
